## A streamlined .gitignore for CapsX C++ project

# CMake build output。build.bat 是一键编译脚本，需要纳入版本库。
build/*
!build/build.bat
build-*/

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib
*.exe
!src/third_party/interception/install-interception.exe
*.dll

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# Others
~$*
*~
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
